{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/91abc295ccebf4e7c2ecc4498e1890c2.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine it's YOU with YOUR FRIENDS who have to fight monsters and demons to save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFake Ducks: Spooky Chronicles\u201d is a turn-based RPG inspired by the great classics and set in the modern day that is about just that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It tells of the misadventures of a group of bizarre friends who, thanks to the powers gained from an ancient pendant, must prevent a mysterious individual from getting his hands on a dark talisman that could compromise the future of the world. There's just one problem... Let's just say that our friends are not the classic heroes expected to save the planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So it's up to you to guide them to success amidst puzzles to solve and strange monsters to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skills and discover what lies behind the diabolical plan of the 'hooded man. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a full-fledged Fake Duck with &quot;Fake Ducks: Spooky Chronicles&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't be fake. Play Fake Ducks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/24d5c9c869043161d46dad81c7a30aa1.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=230 /></span>Face hordes of strange enemies in turn-based combat with simple but strategic and often challenging mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/59b7c72b9fae0243315c35d9da932feb.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=230 /></span>A total of seven levels all to explore and complete, filled with puzzles, riddles, obstacles and hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/0c772564df09dece626dbd28551d109b.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=230 /></span>Form your ideal team with your favorite Fake Ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/1f16c2d6470d7e9cd58ab28a42913e5a.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=230 /></span>Upgrade characters' abilities more and more through the rewards in each level.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Honey ever after!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/335406daba089895462b49792d3efc98c7b66501.jpg"},{"name":"Fake House neat and clean!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/b4c76642c257a247e47c76ded3a4cffc40edf0ce.jpg"},{"name":"Manzooooooo!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/07895065850d2e0e7cebe3298fc5dbde2bdfad8e.jpg"},{"name":"Free countryside!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/f48eb38c7e641c6fed529eeed83b09a52cb5afdf.jpg"},{"name":"Sayonara little ghost!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/d6932b6ccc5204481e650022d2d505b81c4e2618.jpg"},{"name":"Reckless driving!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/af2795c8df48f0af75e33c381de313068663683a.jpg"},{"name":"Extraterrestre go away!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/fbc6774f4a6cfffac98bc704c1df8528e6638585.jpg"},{"name":"Back to Pretare!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/8bc90d611236d36c010c09b48df4a323854c637e.jpg"},{"name":"What a stench!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/76657e5277991f25d426c9f824a00840036389ff.jpg"},{"name":"Stinky but clean sewers!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3125710/67d416db4bbfbca1b95b83433dd75f5fcf660669.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3125710?t=1740467039","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740467039","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/9d61c3a71af151a5b829a7aa5e0b56ae406215dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740467039","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/9d61c3a71af151a5b829a7aa5e0b56ae406215dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740467039","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3291590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/91abc295ccebf4e7c2ecc4498e1890c2.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine it's YOU with YOUR FRIENDS who have to fight monsters and demons to save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cFake Ducks: Spooky Chronicles\u201d is a turn-based RPG inspired by the great classics and set in the modern day that is about just that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It tells of the misadventures of a group of bizarre friends who, thanks to the powers gained from an ancient pendant, must prevent a mysterious individual from getting his hands on a dark talisman that could compromise the future of the world. There's just one problem... Let's just say that our friends are not the classic heroes expected to save the planet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So it's up to you to guide them to success amidst puzzles to solve and strange monsters to defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your skills and discover what lies behind the diabolical plan of the 'hooded man. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a full-fledged Fake Duck with &quot;Fake Ducks: Spooky Chronicles&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't be fake. Play Fake Ducks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/24d5c9c869043161d46dad81c7a30aa1.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=230 /></span>Face hordes of strange enemies in turn-based combat with simple but strategic and often challenging mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/59b7c72b9fae0243315c35d9da932feb.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=230 /></span>A total of seven levels all to explore and complete, filled with puzzles, riddles, obstacles and hidden rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/0c772564df09dece626dbd28551d109b.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=230 /></span>Form your ideal team with your favorite Fake Ducks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/extras/1f16c2d6470d7e9cd58ab28a42913e5a.avif?t=1740467039\" width=616 height=230 /></span>Upgrade characters' abilities more and more through the rewards in each level.</p>","developers":["Mattia De Berardinis"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125710/header.jpg?t=1740467039","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3125710/732822/669c35dbc388882639e323253381c7a06d1b26b4/1750872890/dash_av1.mpd?t=1724826363","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3125710/732822/669c35dbc388882639e323253381c7a06d1b26b4/1750872890/dash_h264.mpd?t=1724826363","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3125710/732822/669c35dbc388882639e323253381c7a06d1b26b4/1750872890/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1724826363","id":257041740,"name":"Fake Ducks: Spooky Chronicles Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257041740/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1724826363"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3125710/790611/905d2148cd2f91c6e97a5bdd5234ebe5ad9a1411/1750872907/dash_av1.mpd?t=1732517927","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3125710/790611/905d2148cd2f91c6e97a5bdd5234ebe5ad9a1411/1750872907/dash_h264.mpd?t=1732517927","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3125710/790611/905d2148cd2f91c6e97a5bdd5234ebe5ad9a1411/1750872907/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1732517927","id":257076352,"name":"Fake Ducks: Spooky Chronicles Gameplay (Headville)","thumbnail":"https://sh